00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:25.740
Midnight Mass is the name of a book in both
Geralds Game and also Hush.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:31.140
The blurb on the book even read: But the 512
souls on sleepy Crocket" and&nbsp; "church put

